chool environment a place students are eager to return to every Monday."], [40, "h2", 4873, 0, 0, "Yunji P."], [70, "h2", 5363, 0, 1, "More Than A School"], [16, "p", 5324, 0, 1, "ISB At A Glance"], [25, "p", 5800, 0, 1, "Spoken languages"], [25, "p", 5800, 0, 1, "Nationalities"], [16, "h2", 6322, 0, 1, "Programme Highlights"], [60, "h2", 6366, 0, 1, "Discover & Experience"], [53, "h2", 6761, 0, 1, "Academics"], [14, "h3", 6836, 0, 1, "Challenging Every Learner"], [16, "p", 6883, 0, 1, "We take pride in challenging the common misconception that schools must choose between inclusivity and high academic achievement. Year-on-year, our committed educators, motivated students, and supportive community prove that personalised learning pathways create an environment where all students can achieve exceptional results and a strong sense of belonging."], [13, "p", 7191, 0, 1, "Learning at ISB"]], "links": [["https://www.isb.be/about", "About"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/mission", "Mission & Strategy"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/legacy", "Our Legacy"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/leadership", "Leadership"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/governance", "Governance"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/news", "News & Media"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/calendar", "School Calendar"], ["https://www.isb.be/about", "About"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/mission", "Mission & Strategy"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/legacy", "Our Legacy"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/leadership", "Leadership"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/governance", "Governance"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/news", "News & Media"], ["https://www.isb.be/about/calendar", "School Calendar"]], "skipped": [["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @section.fsElement fsResourceElement fsSingleItem#slick-slide53", 4800], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @div.fsElementContent#", 3106], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @section.fsElement fsResourceElement fsSingleItem#slick-slide54", 2935], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @section.fsElement fsResourceElement fsSingleItem#slick-slide